# Build-context rules for week2/task_04_containerize/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads
# <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile, so the repo root needs none).
#
# An ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then re-include only what the images COPY.
# Anything new in the repo (a .env, an index, a dataset) stays out by default.
*

!app/
!week1/common/
!week1/capstone_internal_docs_assistant/app.py
!ingest/
!week1/data/
!week2/task_04_containerize/constraints.txt
!week2/task_04_containerize/requirements-api.txt
!week2/task_04_containerize/requirements-api-slim.txt
!week2/task_04_containerize/requirements-ui.txt

# ...and never these, even inside the allowed folders.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/faiss_index
app/README.md
